# Copy to .env.local.
#
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED. The site plays full-length music for every visitor
# with no credentials at all — no Spotify app, no client secret, no Google API
# key, no OAuth. `npm run sync` reads the playlist and finds the matching YouTube
# videos using public endpoints only.
#
# ── You do not normally set this ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Which playlist the site plays. `npm run sync -- <url>` writes this line for
# you; it is not needed on a deployed host, because the app defaults to whatever
# `npm run sync` baked into catalogue.generated.ts. Set it only to override that
# on purpose — and if you do, run `npm run sync` too, or the site falls back to
# 30-second previews.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SPOTIFY_PLAYLIST_ID=

# Absolute origin, used for metadataBase, OG tags, robots and sitemap.
# Worth setting on the host so shared links preview correctly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000

# ── Optional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Override the top-bar links. By default "Spotify" points at the playlist above
# and "YT Music" opens the same songs as a YouTube playlist, both derived
# automatically — set these only to point somewhere else.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SPOTIFY_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_YT_MUSIC_URL=

# Live listener count. Without these the count still works, but it is held in
# one server's memory — fine for a single instance, wrong across several.
# Create a free database at https://console.upstash.com and paste its REST creds.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# ── Optional: Spotify Web Playback SDK ────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Only needed if you want the extra path where a listener CONNECTS a Spotify
# Premium account. Playback does not depend on it — YouTube already serves full
# tracks to everyone — so leaving these blank is the normal case.
#
# The secret is server-side only and must never be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
# SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/spotify/callback
